{
  "name": "S08 Review reply drafts (human approves)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## What this does\n\nA review notification email arrives. The star rating is read in code. Only 1-3 star reviews get an AI-drafted reply (calm, no excuses, invites them to talk offline). The draft goes to your Slack approvals channel. A human pastes it. Nothing is ever posted for you.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-1",
      "name": "What this does",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1000,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup in 4 steps\n\n1. Import and connect Gmail, Groq (OpenAI-compatible) and Slack credentials.\n2. Point the Gmail Trigger search at your review-notification emails.\n3. Create the #approvals channel (placeholder in the Slack node).\n4. Send yourself a test notification, then enable the Slack node.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky-2",
      "name": "Setup in 4 steps",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -520,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Safety: never auto-posts\n\nSIMULATED - enable after credentials. There is no node that posts to Google, Facebook or Yelp. The Slack message is disabled by default; it only ever asks a human to review. Max 50 emails per poll.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "sticky-3",
      "name": "Safety: never auto-posts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        },
        "simple": true,
        "filters": {
          "q": "from:noreply@example.com subject:review"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "t-gmail",
      "name": "Gmail Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmailTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -900,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "name": "Gmail account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "maxItems": 50
      },
      "id": "cap",
      "name": "Cap 50 per run",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.limit",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -640,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "const t = ($json.snippet || $json.text || '');\nconst m = t.match(/(\\d)\\s*-?\\s*stars?/i) || t.match(/(\\d)\\s*\\/\\s*5/);\nconst stars = m ? Number(m[1]) : 0;\nreturn { json: { review_text: t.slice(0, 1500), stars } };"
      },
      "id": "parse",
      "name": "Parse stars",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -380,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.stars }}",
              "rightValue": 1,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gte"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "c2",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.stars }}",
              "rightValue": 3,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "lte"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "low",
      "name": "Stars 3 or less?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        -120,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Review ({{ $json.stars }} stars): {{ $json.review_text }}",
        "hasOutputParser": false,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "You write short replies to unhappy customer reviews for a small business. Calm and kind. No excuses, no blame, no promises of refunds. Thank them, say sorry it fell short, invite them to contact owner@example.com or call +1 555 010 0000 to put it right. Max 70 words."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "draft",
      "name": "Draft calm reply",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        140,
        -20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "llama-3.3-70b-versatile"
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.2
        }
      },
      "id": "lm-19",
      "name": "Groq chat model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        140,
        220
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "name": "Groq (OpenAI-compatible)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "#approvals"
        },
        "text": "=Draft reply for a {{ $('Stars 3 or less?').item.json.stars }}-star review. Copy, edit, post by hand:\n\n{{ $json.text }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "slack",
      "name": "Post to #approvals (simulated)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "name": "Slack account"
        }
      },
      "disabled": true
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Gmail Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Cap 50 per run",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Cap 50 per run": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Parse stars",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Parse stars": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Stars 3 or less?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Draft calm reply": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Post to #approvals (simulated)",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Stars 3 or less?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Draft calm reply",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        []
      ]
    },
    "Groq chat model": {
      "ai_languageModel": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Draft calm reply",
            "type": "ai_languageModel",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "saveDataSuccessExecution": "all"
  },
  "active": false
}